/-!
# Part 86, frozen definitions: Theorem 1 (the line program) at every degree pair, by conditioning
on the `d + 1` anchors, slice by slice, with a threshold of single-exponential size

Role: `delegations/statements/p86-spec.md`. This file holds definitions and `Prop`-valued interface
statements only. Do not edit this file. Do not use `sorry`, `native_decide` or `axiom`.

## The abstract model (`Mod`)

* `I` indexes the anchor features `b_j(x)`, `J` indexes the residual features `ψ_q(x)`; both are
  polynomials in `x` (`bP`, `psP`).
* The input distribution is the image of a product `π ⊗ γ` under `X : S × G → ℝⁿ`: `p ∈ S` names a
  slice, `g ∈ G` is the position in the slice.
* `𝒫` is a polynomial on `ℝ^I × ℝⁿ` (it plays `(b, z) ↦ f(U b + σ z)`), `lam` is a scale near `1`,
  `W` is standard Gaussian on `J × Fin n`:
  `Fm M 𝒫 lam W x = 𝒫(b(x), lam · W ψ(x))`.
* Slice quantities at `p`: `msl` (the mean over `g`), `Ysl` (the variance over `g`),
  `gsl` (the mean over `g` of `Φ₁(x) = E_W F_x` at `lam = 1`).
* Totals: `Bm = E_p msl`, `Vm = Var_{p,g} F`, `Vdn = E_p Ysl` (within-slice variance),
  `Esl = E_p (msl − gsl)²`, `gD = E_p gsl`, `Tm = Var_p gsl`, `R1 = E_p Var_g Φ₁`.
-/

namespace BstLean.Part86

open MeasureTheory
open scoped ENNReal
open BstLean.Part29 (stdGauss uniformSphere)
open BstLean.Part36 (CoefIdxD DD unitOfD mapMD)
open BstLean.Part41 (Mono phiM colM varU frob IsSymmT Tens TSymm fval)
open BstLean.Part43 (BofQ varFQ)
open BstLean.Part53 (heatA tinner fvA unitF53 radF53)
open BstLean.Part56 (UnitV lawRK surrRK KRK phiB kJ KR tauR ancRK gLineW axialMeasure polarState
  polarPoint perpDir axialR axialS)
